# Working memory

Agents update this file. It is the living snapshot of the project.

## Status

- **Status:** active
- **Updated:** 2026-09-20

## Project

- **Name:** Volleyball Manager (`volleyball-manager`)
- **Purpose:** Club platform for admins, coaches, players, and parents — seasons, rosters, live game stats.
- **Audience:** Youth/club volleyball (ADMIN, COACH, PLAYER, PARENT).
- **Stack:** Next.js 14 App Router + Tailwind (`apps/web-client`); NestJS (`apps/api-server`); PostgreSQL + Prisma (`packages/database`); Socket.io; npm workspaces; Docker Compose.
- **Package manager:** npm workspaces (Node 18+)
- **Deploy target:** Local Docker Compose first. Production host unset.

## Current focus

- First slice is **implemented** on `cursor/start-new-app-b09f`: JWT login, active-season games, event-sourced stats, Socket.io live board.
- Demo: sign in as coach → open Fall 2026 game → tap a stat → parent board updates without reload.
- Next modules (do not start until asked): volunteer, iCal, announcements, coach notes, season archive UI.

